# Build-artifact / VCS excludes for the demo-platform runner image, which uses
# the repo root as its build context (COPY . /workspace). All entries here are
# regenerated or irrelevant inside a container image, so excluding them keeps the
# context small and the runner image lean. App services build from their own
# subdirectories and are unaffected.
.git
**/node_modules
**/.terraform
**/.terraform.lock.hcl
**/.next
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/npm-debug.log*

# Credentials and local secrets. The runner image is pushed to a shared registry
# and only needs scripts/, demo-platform/ and the deploy manifests, so nothing
# below may enter the build context. .gitignore does not apply here: gitignored
# local files (.env, Helm secrets.yaml, tfvars) would otherwise be copied too.
# demo-platform/runner/Dockerfile fails the build if any of these slip through.
etl/config.ini
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.env
!**/.env.example
!infrastructure/helm/tenant-values/**/eventing.env
**/secrets.yaml
**/secrets.yml
**/*-secrets.yaml
**/*.tfvars
**/*.tfvars.json
!**/*.tfvars.example
!platform/terraform/environments/*.tfvars
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
**/.npmrc
**/.netrc
**/.pgpass
**/.aws
**/.kube
**/kubeconfig*
.demo
